# Mapbox public token used by the booking flow's address autocomplete
# and RouteX delivery routing (map rendering + optimization API).
#
# Get a token at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# Restrict the token in the Mapbox dashboard to this site's domain.
# This value is exposed to the browser by design (public token), so the
# URL restriction is what protects it.
#
# Without it the address fields fall back to plain text entry
# and RouteX shows a mock map with simulated routes.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# OpenRouter API key for AI business insights in the admin dashboard.
#
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# In production, proxy this through a server endpoint to avoid exposing the key.
#
# Without it the AI insights tab shows a placeholder message.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Brevo (formerly Sendinblue) API key for RouteX delivery email notifications.
#
# Get a key at https://app.brevo.com/settings/keys/api
# In production, proxy this through a server endpoint to avoid exposing the key.
#
# Without it email sending is disabled (route optimization still works).
VITE_BREVO_API_KEY=
